<!-- 手动记账：一次语音都不用，也能完成完整一单（选商品→数量→单价→方向→生成卡片） -->
<view data-ui="v1" class="page">
  <view class="tip">不想说话就点着记。和语音走同一条解析、同一条落账链路，最后还要在卡片上确认。</view>

  <num-keyboard
    quantity="{{quantity}}"
    price="{{price}}"
    products="{{products}}"
    product="{{product}}"
    direction="{{direction}}"
    bind:product="onProduct"
    bind:direction="onDirection"
    bind:input="onInput"
    bind:submit="onSubmit"
  />

  <view class="preview-card">
    <view class="preview-card__label">会记成这句话</view>
    <view class="preview-card__text">{{preview}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="error" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>
  <view class="submitting" wx:if="{{submitting}}">生成卡片中…</view>
</view>
